From 418e305778858e494cd39c7ff57ec1ebaf16efeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:12:53 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/25] kcm_cursortheme: themes scanned after the first frame,
 Launch Feedback on a sub-page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Gallery (docs/page-design.md section 5). Config keys (kcminputrc Mouse/cursorTheme, cursorSize, the
launch-feedback keys in klaunchrc and plasmarc), the XCursor code, KNS config, plasma-apply-cursortheme are unchanged.
NOT BUILT YET (owner stopped heavy work); checked statically only.

Moved / renamed:
- "Configure Launch Feedback…" was a popup Kirigami.Dialog; now the page action "Launch Feedback…" -> kcm.push
  ("LaunchFeedbackPage.qml", renamed from LaunchFeedbackDialog.qml), a Form page: "Pointer feedback:" (None, Static,
  Blinking, Bouncing, same one radio group over three keys), "Task Manager feedback:" checkbox "Enable animation" ->
  "Animate the launching application's button" (no "Enable" prefix), a section "Duration" (noun) with "Stop animations
  after:" (was an empty section spacer). The intro sentence is a small help line under the radios.
- Toolbar stays as page actions top right: Size combo, Launch Feedback…, Install from File…, Get New…; per theme
  Remove / Don't delete stay GridDelegate actions. Empty state: "No pointer themes found" with the Install from File…
  action; busy indicator only after 150 ms.
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_cursortheme.tsv (outer repo). Inventory --strict: 10 rows ok, 0 lost.
- HIG ids: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-057; page-design sections 3, 5, 7.

Speed (cause found in code, not measured):
- The CursorThemeConfig constructor built CursorThemeModel, whose constructor ran insertThemes() synchronously
  (thememodel.cpp): QDir::entryList of every icon search path (~/.icons, /usr/share/icons, ...), and for each directory
  an index.theme/cursors check and an XCursorTheme (index.theme parse), then CursorThemeConfig::load() called
  updateSizeComboBox(), which renders two QPixmaps per available size of the selected theme (theme->createIcon). All
  before the first frame.
- Now: CursorThemeModel(parent, loadNow=false) and CursorThemeModel::load(); the KCM scans in loadThemes() from
  QTimer::singleShot(0), with the proxy's dynamic sort off during the scan (one sort at the end), then
  updateSizeComboBox() (needsSave kept as it was). New property kcm.themesLoaded; the grid has no model and
  currentIndex -1 until it is true, and the index-changed handler does not write the theme back before then (so a
  half-built list can never overwrite the setting). plasma-apply-cursortheme still uses the default (immediate) constructor.
- Not changed: PreviewWidget (QQuickPaintedItem) still paints each visible card's cursors synchronously on the GUI
  thread; GridView only creates visible delegates.
- After numbers: pending, manager will measure.

Not built yet; uncertain: that setNeedsSave(false) after the deferred updateSizeComboBox() is right for a managed module
(mirrors load()); QSortFilterProxyModel::setDynamicSortFilter(true) re-sorts as documented; header actions use
kcm.push from a Kirigami.Action inside GridViewKCM as kcm_style does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
